d 'SIMAN': module providing suite of analysing the results of simulation studies and producing graphs
d
d  A suite of programs for the analysis of simulation studies:
d importing estimates data, computing performance measures and
d graphing the results. It is based around the ADEMP structure of
d Morris et al (2019) and builds on the analysis facilities in
d simsum. 
d
d KW: simulkation
d KW: graphics
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261122
d
d Author: Ian White, MRC Clinical Trials Unit at UCL
d Support: email ian.white@@ucl.ac.uk
d
d Author:  Ella Marley-Zagar, MRC Clinical Trials Unit at UCL
d Support: email e.marley-zagar@@ucl.ac.uk
d
d Author: Tim P. Morris, University College London
d Support: email tim.morris@@ucl.ac.uk
d
